# Reproducibility

- Pin tool and package versions in env files (`environment.yml`, lockfiles). Do not invent version numbers.
- Record random seeds when used. Prefer relative paths over machine-specific absolute paths.
- Keep settings in config files (YAML/TOML), not hidden env vars or hard-coded machine paths.
- Log executed commands and versions when a run is part of the deliverable.
- Prefer the project conda env over ad-hoc global installs.

Missing pins: report the gap; do not guess versions.
